# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/fuchs2025chemtrain.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: Allegro, MACE and PaiNN models trained by the authors
# (chemtrain, JAX) on ANI-AL (aluminium), SPICE and H2O-PBE0TS, with the
# energy and force errors of Table 1; literature reference values in the
# same table are not encoded. Scaling, memory and runtime results are
# system benchmarks shown mostly in figures.

